  "limitations": [
    "Section4.5.2 says the default exact reference does not capture the intermediate shock. Published states therefore do not establish a unique full Brio-Wu compound-wave branch.",
    "Table1 supplies extracted end states for isolated waves. Its intermediate-shock entry spans a compound structure, not a single Rankine-Hugoniot discontinuity.",
    "Two published plateau samples are a partial literature replication, not a reconstruction of every published numerical curve or a unique exact full Brio-Wu solution.",
    "The 1D benchmark does not exercise production PLM/SSPRK2, 3D CT, spherical geometry, gravity, rotating map boundaries, thermodynamic closure, or spacecraft skill; those require their separate recorded gates.",
